":330,"text":"• Thermodynamica: waar ligt het evenwicht? Kinetiek: hoe snel, en via welke stappen?","size":13.5},"t8":{"id":"t8","x":22,"y":349,"text":"• r = dc/dt, met een min voor een reactant: de snelheid is altijd positief.","size":13.5},"t9":{"id":"t9","x":22,"y":368,"text":"• Gemiddelde snelheid: lijn tussen twee punten. Snelheid op één tijdstip: raaklijn.","size":13.5},"t10":{"id":"t10","x":0,"y":442,"text":"2. Snelheidsvergelijking en orde","bold":true,"size":21,"color":"#3b6fd4"},"t11":{"id":"t11","x":22,"y":510,"text":"Als je de concentratie van een stof verdubbelt, gaat de reactie dan twee keer zo snel, vier keer, of","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t12":{"id":"t12","x":22,"y":529,"text":"helemaal niet sneller? Dat zegt de orde. Met de orde kun je ook iets zeggen over het mechanisme.","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t13":{"id":"t13","x":22,"y":611,"text":"• r = k[A]ⁿ[B]ᵐ; totale orde = n + m.","size":13.5},"t14":{"id":"t14","x":22,"y":630,"text":"• Verdubbel een stof van orde 1: ×2. Van orde 2: ×4. Van orde 0: ×1.","size":13.5},"t15":{"id":"t15","x":22,"y":649,"text":"• Orde uit een proef: fⁿ = F, dus n = log F / log f.","size":13.5},"t16":{"id":"t16","x":0,"y":723,"text":"3. Activeringsenergie en energiediagram","bold":true,"size":21,"color":"#3b6fd4"},"t17":{"id":"t17","x":22,"y":791,"text":"Ook als er bij een reactie energie vrijkomt, moeten de moleculen eerst over een drempel. Hoe hoog die","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t18":{"id":"t18","x":22,"y":810,"text":"drempel is, bepaalt hoe snel de reactie gaat. In een energiediagram zie je die drempel, en bij een","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t19":{"id":"t19","x":22,"y":829,"text":"reactie met meer stappen zie je welke stap de snelheid bepaalt.","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t20":{"id":"t20","x":22,"y":911,"text":"• Ea = top min begin. ΔG = eind min begin.","size":13.5},"t21":{"id":"t21","x":22,"y":930,"text":"• De hoogste overgangstoestand bepaalt de snelheid.","size":13.5},"t22":{"id":"t22","x":22,"y":949,"text":"• Uhura: Eₐ ≈ 0,7 Everbroken - 0,3 Enieuw.","size":13.5},"t23":{"id":"t23","x":0,"y":1023,"text":"4. Kinetiek van SN1, SN2, E1 en E2","bold":true,"size":21,"color":"#3b6fd4"},"t24":{"id":"t24","x":22,"y":1091,"text":"Uit Organische Synthese 1 ken je substitutie en eliminatie. De cijfers 1 en 2 in SN1 en SN2 gaan over","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t25":{"id":"t25","x":22,"y":1110,"text":"kinetiek: hoeveel deeltjes zitten er in de langzame stap? Dat lees je af aan de snelheidsvergelijking.","size":13.5,"italic":true},"t26":{"id":"t26","x":22,"y":1192,"text":"• SN2 en E2: één stap, tweede orde, r hangt af van substraat én nucleofiel of base.","size":13.5},"t27":{"id":"t27","x":22,"y":1211,"text":"• SN1 en E1: twee stappen via een carbokation, eerste orde, r hangt alleen af van het substraat.","size":13.5},"t28":{"id":"t28","x":22,"y":1230,"text":"• De langzame stap van SN1 en E1 is het afsplitsen van de vertrekkende groep.","size":13.5},"t29":{"id":"t29","x":22,"y":1296,"text":"SN2: broommethaan + OH⁻. Links de pijlen, rechts het product, met de atomen op dezelfde plek. De drie","size":14,"bold":true},"t30":{"id":"t30","x":22,"y":1315,"text":"H-atomen klappen om.","size":14,"bold":true},"t31":{"id":"t31","text":"broommethaan + OH⁻","x":30,"y":1457,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t32":{"id":"t32","text":"methanol + Br⁻","x":370,"y":1457,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t33":{"id":"t33","x":22,"y":1489.8,"text":"Waarom: Het C-atoom is δ+ omdat Br de elektronen naar zich toe trekt. Het nucleofiel (elektronenrijk)","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t34":{"id":"t34","x":22,"y":1508.8,"text":"zoekt dat C (elektronenarm). De aanval en het vertrek gebeuren tegelijk. Daarom botsen in die ene stap","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t35":{"id":"t35","x":22,"y":1527.8,"text":"twee deeltjes, en hangt de snelheid van beide concentraties af.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t36":{"id":"t36","x":22,"y":1593.8,"text":"SN1: 2-broom-2-methylpropaan + water. Stap 2: water valt het carbokation aan.","size":14,"bold":true},"t37":{"id":"t37","text":".","x":30,"y":1620.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t38":{"id":"t38","text":".","x":300,"y":1820.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t39":{"id":"t39","text":"α","x":130,"y":1711.8,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t40":{"id":"t40","text":"snel","x":170,"y":1755.8,"color":"#d64545","italic":true,"size":12},"t41":{"id":"t41","x":22,"y":1851.2,"text":"Waarom: Een tertiair carbokation is stabiel genoeg om vanzelf te ontstaan. Dat ontstaan kost veel energie","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t42":{"id":"t42","x":22,"y":1870.2,"text":"en is dus de langzame stap. Water komt pas daarna, in een snelle stap. Wat na de langzame stap gebeurt,","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t43":{"id":"t43","x":22,"y":1889.2,"text":"heeft geen invloed op de snelheid. Daarom telt alleen het substraat.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t44":{"id":"t44","x":22,"y":1955.2,"text":"Stap 1 (langzaam). De pijl begint in de C–Br-binding en wijst naar Br: Br neemt beide elektronen mee en","size":14,"bold":true},"t45":{"id":"t45","x":22,"y":1974.2,"text":"het α-C wordt C⁺.","size":14,"bold":true},"t46":{"id":"t46","text":".","x":30,"y":2001.2,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t47":{"id":"t47","text":".","x":300,"y":2201.2,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t48":{"id":"t48","text":"α","x":130,"y":2092.2,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t49":{"id":"t49","text":"langzaam","x":195,"y":2106.2,"color":"#d64545","italic":true,"size":12},"t50":{"id":"t50","x":22,"y":2274.6,"text":"Stap 3. Een tweede watermolecuul pakt een H van de O⁺; de pijl in de O–H-binding laat de elektronen op O","size":14,"bold":true},"t51":{"id":"t51","x":22,"y":2293.6,"text":"achter.","size":14,"bold":true},"t52":{"id":"t52","text":".","x":30,"y":2320.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t53":{"id":"t53","text":".","x":300,"y":2520.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t54":{"id":"t54","text":"α","x":130,"y":2411.6,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t55":{"id":"t55","x":22,"y":2605.6,"text":"Product. 2-Methyl-2-propanol (tert-butanol), plus H₃O⁺ en Br⁻.","size":14,"bold":true},"t56":{"id":"t56","text":".","x":30,"y":2632.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t57":{"id":"t57","text":".","x":300,"y":2832.6,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t58":{"id":"t58","text":"α","x":130,"y":2723.6,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t59":{"id":"t59","text":"+ H₃O⁺","x":210,"y":2817.6,"size":14},"t60":{"id":"t60","x":22,"y":2906,"text":"E2: 2-broom-2-methylpropaan + OH⁻. De H op het β-C gaat naar OH⁻, de C=C ontstaat tussen α en β, Br","size":14,"bold":true},"t61":{"id":"t61","x":22,"y":2925,"text":"vertrekt.","size":14,"bold":true},"t62":{"id":"t62","text":"α","x":59,"y":3016,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t63":{"id":"t63","text":"β","x":119,"y":2998,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t64":{"id":"t64","text":"α","x":369,"y":3016,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t65":{"id":"t65","text":"β","x":429,"y":2998,"color":"#d64545","bold":true,"size":12},"t66":{"id":"t66","text":"2-broom-2-methylpropaan + OH⁻","x":69,"y":3100,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t67":{"id":"t67","text":"2-methylpropeen + H₂O + Br⁻","x":329,"y":3100,"color":"#555555","italic":true,"size":12},"t68":{"id":"t68","x":22,"y":3132.8,"text":"Waarom: Drie pijlen in één stap: base naar H, C–H-binding naar de C–C-binding, C–Br-binding naar Br.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t69":{"id":"t69","x":22,"y":3151.8,"text":"Omdat de base in die ene stap meedoet, hangt de snelheid ook van [OH⁻] af.","size":13,"italic":true,"color":"#6b7280"},"t70":{"id":"t70","x":22,"y":3217.8,"text":"Stap 2. Water gebruikt een elektronenpaar om een H van het β-C te pakken; de elektronen van die","size":14,"bold":true},"t71":{"id":"t71","x":22,"y":3236.8,"text":"C–H-binding vormen de C=C.","size":14,"bold":true},"t72":{"id":"t72","text":".","x":30,"y":3263.8,"color":"#ffffff","size":6},"t73":{"id":"t